  description: "Gloomslime began as a synthetic microorganism meant to absorb radiation
    safely. Instead, it adapted\u2014developing collective intelligence across its
    amorphous body. Prolonged exposure to darkness and energy flux caused it to produce
    hallucinogenic emissions. Scientists fear Gloomslime is still evolving, learning
    from every encounter."
